  "description": "Mountain, valleys, tarmac, gravel – the Multistreet XT Trekking is your partner for all challenges. Outstanding quality and high reliability are at the top of this agenda for this bike – our guarantee to you for many unforgettable tours. The stylish, lightweight frame made from 6013 T6/2 Altanium aluminium with elegant design and smooth seams creates enormous agility – a real sports ace with great speed potential. On the ergonomic Terry Figura GTC Gel saddle you will sit well even after hours. ERGON GA30 grips also contribute comfort. The drivetrain consists of a complete Shimano shifting system. First created for MTB sports, it adds highest reliability and great functionality. The disc brakes, too, carry the XT label. Bad weather and brutal descents, even with luggage, are challenges it takes on with a smile. High-quality, hand laced ROSE R Thirty Disc wheels house a Shimano hub dynamo that powers a Supernova E3 PURE 3 headlight and a minimalist E3 Tail Light 2 at the rear. You see, everything ready for your next adventure! * approx. 11.3 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for matt black/shiny grey/shiny red frame, 19”, without pedals",
